        <note type="editorial">Liebermann’s <hi rend="italic">foreg~</hi> (the tilde repeats <hi rend="italic">-genga</hi>) is <hi rend="italic">foregenga</hi>. The dictionary’s entry for it is headed with the plural, <ref target="entry:foregengan">foregengan</ref> (‘forebears’, Af El 49,9; <hi rend="italic">forg~</hi> in MS So, and <hi rend="italic">forgængan</hi> in V Atr 32,3 D), so the headword linked differs slightly from the form the tilde gives.</note>
        <xr type="see"><ref target="entry:foregengan">foregengan</ref></xr>
